      "limits": [
        "The guards refuse deleted tasks (is_deleted true) and tasks without content; the code lens also refuses an empty content and a non-boolean checked.",
        "Doing and Blocked have no Todoist equivalent: a row with either status cannot be read back through this lens (unmapped-value).",
        "Assignee, labels, priority and parent are not mapped.",
