    "raindrop-bookmark-v2": {
      "name": "Raindrop bookmark ↔ Bookmark",
      "description": "A Raindrop.io bookmark record and the host's built-in Bookmark class: title, link and excerpt. A description removed in the table clears the excerpt, and an excerpt missing in Raindrop removes the description.",
      "source": {
        "record": {
          "provider": "raindrop.io",
          "resource": "raindrop"
        }
      },
      "target": {
        "class": "https://atomicdata.dev/class/Bookmark"
      },
      "mapping": {
        "version": 3,
        "fields": [
          {
            "source": "/title",
            "target": "https://atomicdata.dev/properties/name"
          },
          {
            "source": "/link",
            "target": "https://atomicdata.dev/property/url"
          },
          {
            "source": "/excerpt",
            "target": "https://atomicdata.dev/properties/description",
            "absent": "default",
            "default": ""
          }
        ],
        "guards": [
          {
            "at": "/_id",
            "is": "present"
          }
        ]
      },
      "limits": [
        "No overlay declares a Raindrop crudResource yet, so no catalog integration produces this source; the record endpoint names the shape the code lens reads.",
        "The guard refuses a record without an _id; the code lens also refuses a non-positive id, titles over 1000 and excerpts over 10000 UTF-16 code units, and a link that is not an absolute http(s) URL."
      ],
      "implementation": "integrations/bookmarks/devonian/raindrop/lens/index.ts",
      "examples": [
        {
          "source": {
            "_id": 41,
            "title": "A bookmark",
            "link": "https://example.org/article",
            "tags": ["invented"],
            "note": "Provider-only note",
            "created": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+02:00"
          },
